us/human herpesvirus 8 in several regions of Italy</article-title><source>J Hum Virol</source><year>1998</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>207</fpage><lpage>213</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Hum Virol||1|207||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10195244</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Coluzzi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Calabr&#x000f2;</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Manno</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Chieco-Bianchi</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Schulz</surname><given-names>TF</given-names></name><name><surname>Ascoli</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reduced seroprevalence of Kaposi's sarcoma-associated herpesvirus (KSHV), human herpesvirus 8 (HHV8), related to suppression of Anopheles density in Italy</article-title><source>Med Vet Entomol</source><year>2003</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>4</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Med Vet Entomol||17|1||bib7|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12680919</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cottoni</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>De Marco</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Montesu</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Classical Kaposi's sarcoma in north-east Sardinia: an overview from 1977 to 1991</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1996</year><volume>72</volume><fpage>1132</fpage><lpage>1133</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||72|1132||bib8|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dal Maso</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Braga</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Franceschi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Methodology used for &#x02018;Software for Automated Linkage in Italy' (SALI)</article-title><source>J Biomed Informatics</source><year>2001a</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>387</fpage><lpage>395</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Biomed Informatics||34|387||bib9|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dal Maso</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Franceschi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lo Re</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>La Vecchia</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of the distribution of non-AIDS Kaposi's sarcoma and non-Hodgkin's lymphoma in Europe</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1999</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>161</fpage><lpage>163</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||79|161||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10408708</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dal Maso</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Franceschi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Polesel</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Braga</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Piselli</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Crocetti</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Falcini</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Guzzinati</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Zanetti</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Vercelli</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rezza</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><collab>Cancer and AIDS Re